  The article names only one person, தமிழ்ச்செல்வன், who took part in the darshan, but the draft says 'அமைச்சர்கள்' (ministers) took part; the article does not state that they were ministers, so the role is invented.
  The draft says 'அமைச்சர்கள் பங்கேற்பு' / 'அமைச்சர்கள் கலந்துகொண்டு' in the headline and slides, which conflicts with the article's single named person (தமிழ்ச்செல்வன்); the article's role for him is not stated.
  The article says 'பெரியசாமி கோவில்' but the draft describes the ceremony as held at the Mariamman temple's procession start and then at 'பெரியசாமி கோவில்'; the article is cut off and does not clearly confirm the Maha Kumbabhishekam was at Periyasamy temple specifically, though this is consistent with the headline.
  The reel_script and caption say the ceremony was 'நடைபெற்றது' with a clear completed event, but the article's text is truncated mid-sentence ('விழா ஏற்பாடுகளை கோவில்') so the stated completion and the organising detail 'கோவில் நிர்வாகம்' are not supported by the visible article text.
  The slide 'விவரம் இன்னும் தெரியவரவில்லை' ('details not yet known') is not supported by the article and adds an unverified statement about missing information.
